      "comment": "OUTSHINE (8) has a strong record this track and trip with 10 wins and eight placings from 25 starts. Below best last time at this track (19.75) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 3 length fourth. Appeals as a leading chance in this. YVONNE'S PICK (1) turned in a moderate performance last time when sixth at this track over 300m behind Sebea (17.29) in a Invitation. Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Has ability and can atone. BRUNO CHOCOLATE (7) went straight to the front and never headed when winning two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished 4th and beaten 5.5 lengths at this track (17.61). Expected to give a good account. SEBON DIVA (2) is not to be discarded.",
